<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$65.0 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIAN P-NOTES - Tenders total A$65.0 mln.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Australian commercial paper market digested A$65.0 million worth of promissory notes issued via tenders on Friday.</p>
<p>General Property Trust led with a A$50 million issue, having kicked off Australian p-note issuance for the year with a A$40 million sale on Thursday.</p>
<p>At 0007 GMT (11.07 a.m.) March bill futures were trading three points lower at 94.13.</p>
